{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity is just a suggestion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a Daedalus Industries mining facility medbay near the moon Titan with chaos unfolding around you and a strange barcode on your wrist. Lost and confused, your only lifeline is &quot;Z&quot;, a mysterious faceless figure who is asking for your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/361d4d244e6fe29c458ee6ca03eccf99.poster.avif?t=1764783020\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/361d4d244e6fe29c458ee6ca03eccf99.webm?t=1764783020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/361d4d244e6fe29c458ee6ca03eccf99.mp4?t=1764783020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>dynamic gravity mechanics</strong> that let you walk on walls, flip orientation mid-combat, and navigate complex multi-directional environments. Use physics-based movement to outmaneuver gravity-bound enemies, manipulate objects, and push foes around the battlefield and into environmental traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across multiple distinct locations - from the abandoned mining facility where you awaken to the utopian colony ship Talos VII. Piece together the truth behind your missing memories while following the enigmatic guidance of &quot;Z.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/bc406542bd3b242926b145185554671c.poster.avif?t=1764783020\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/bc406542bd3b242926b145185554671c.webm?t=1764783020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>classic retro FPS action</strong> with a modern twist. Fast-paced combat, environmental storytelling, and secrets waiting to be discovered. Coming 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic gravity\u00a0</strong>- manipulate gravity to walk on walls and ceilings while (most) enemies stay grounded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based combat</strong> - push enemies and manipulate environmental objects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic retro FPS gameplay</strong> - fast-paced combat with weapons that pack a punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique weapon and ability mod system</strong> - Discover rare weapon and ability modifications hidden in secret locations; increase firing rates, add new secondary attacks, gain double jump ability and more.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640450?t=1764783020","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640450?t=1764783020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/96556c6e8ffff979e9c05836435ed4019f3f48f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764783020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/96556c6e8ffff979e9c05836435ed4019f3f48f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764783020","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity is just a suggestion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a Daedalus Industries mining facility medbay near the moon Titan with chaos unfolding around you and a strange barcode on your wrist. Lost and confused, your only lifeline is &quot;Z&quot;, a mysterious faceless figure who is asking for your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/361d4d244e6fe29c458ee6ca03eccf99.poster.avif?t=1764783020\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/361d4d244e6fe29c458ee6ca03eccf99.webm?t=1764783020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/361d4d244e6fe29c458ee6ca03eccf99.mp4?t=1764783020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>dynamic gravity mechanics</strong> that let you walk on walls, flip orientation mid-combat, and navigate complex multi-directional environments. Use physics-based movement to outmaneuver gravity-bound enemies, manipulate objects, and push foes around the battlefield and into environmental traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across multiple distinct locations - from the abandoned mining facility where you awaken to the utopian colony ship Talos VII. Piece together the truth behind your missing memories while following the enigmatic guidance of &quot;Z.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/bc406542bd3b242926b145185554671c.poster.avif?t=1764783020\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/extras/bc406542bd3b242926b145185554671c.webm?t=1764783020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>classic retro FPS action</strong> with a modern twist. Fast-paced combat, environmental storytelling, and secrets waiting to be discovered. Coming 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic gravity\u00a0</strong>- manipulate gravity to walk on walls and ceilings while (most) enemies stay grounded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based combat</strong> - push enemies and manipulate environmental objects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic retro FPS gameplay</strong> - fast-paced combat with weapons that pack a punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique weapon and ability mod system</strong> - Discover rare weapon and ability modifications hidden in secret locations; increase firing rates, add new secondary attacks, gain double jump ability and more.</p></li></ul>","developers":["StayAtHomeDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640450/1a6efefeafd1744a44d5d0310f5eb55419fcf6c1/header.jpg?t=1764783020","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3640450/2131912481/f7d10877ee4d86878b9c92365e3adbc8ef7cf171/1764782391/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764783019","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3640450/2131912481/f7d10877ee4d86878b9c92365e3adbc8ef7cf171/1764782391/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764783019","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile